Package: PhysioCore
Title: Compatibility Layer for the PhysioExperiment Data Model
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yusuke",
           family = "Matsui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: Compatibility package. The shared data model that used to live
    here -- the PhysioExperiment class and the containers for multiple streams,
    repeated sessions and cohorts -- now lives in the 'PhysioExperiment'
    package. This package re-exports that public interface unchanged, so
    existing code written against 'PhysioCore' keeps working, including
    'S4' objects saved while the classes were defined here. New code should
    depend on 'PhysioExperiment' directly.
biocViews: Software, Infrastructure, DataRepresentation, TimeCourse
